{
  "description": "The creature is a slender, donkey-like equine shown in strict right-facing profile against a plain off-white background. Its body is elongated with a slightly arched back and a pale, lightly haired underbelly, covered in short brown to gray-brown fur that is darker along the back, neck and outer legs and lighter on the muzzle and inner thighs. The head is held forward on a moderately long neck, the ears are large and upright, the mane is short and bristly, and the tail is thin with a tufted tip hanging behind the hindquarters. All four slender legs end in hooves and support the animal in a standing pose, with no other bodies, wings, or appendages visible.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated equine head with a brown face, a white patch around the muzzle and nostrils, a dark eye with a light ring, a dark nostril and a closed mouth with visible lips and chin whiskers",
      "where": "at the anterior right end of the body, attached to the neck and facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, upright, pointed ears with dark brown outer edges, lighter tan inner surfaces, dark interior markings and small tufts of hair at the tips",
      "where": "on top of the head, set close together and angled slightly outward"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "short, stiff, upright bristly hair, dark brown to black with lighter tips, forming a crest",
      "where": "along the dorsal midline of the neck from just behind the ears to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight legs with visible knee and hock joints, brown on the outer surfaces and paler gray-white on the inner thighs and lower forelegs, with subtle musculature and wrinkled skin at the joints",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the rump, extending vertically to the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four rounded, solid hooves, light gray-brown with a darker edge at the coronet and a flat sole, slightly worn",
      "where": "one at the distal tip of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "a thin tail with short hair along its length and a longer, darker brown tuft of coarse hair at the tip",
      "where": "extending from the posterior left end of the rump, hanging vertically behind the hindlegs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "a thin dark dorsal stripe along the spine from behind the mane to the tail base, slightly darker shading on the shoulders, flanks and lower neck, and a white muzzle and pale underbelly contrasting with the brown coat",
      "where": "along the mid-back, on the torso and on the face and ventral surface"
    }
  ],
